   "he": "וְשָׁוִין בְּסוּכַּת הֶחָג בֶּחָג שֶׁהִיא אֲסוּרָה, וְאִם הִתְנָה עָלֶיהָ — הַכֹּל לְפִי תְנָאוֹ. וּמִי מַהֲנֵי בַּהּ תְּנַאי?",
   "en": "§ The above baraita states: «All agree with regard to the sukka» that was built for the «festival» of Sukkot, that «during the Festival it is prohibited» to remove wood from it, «but if one stipulated» a condition «with regard to it,» it is «all according to his condition.» The Gemara asks: «And is a condition effective with» regard to «it?»"
